@DataPartitioningProject.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5187

### Variants of a random campaign (endpoint used by the NBomber load test)
GET {{DataPartitioningProject.API_HostAddress}}/variant-campaigns
Accept: application/json

### Variants of a campaign, read from the partitioned VariantCampaigns table
GET {{DataPartitioningProject.API_HostAddress}}/campaigns/42/variants
Accept: application/json

### Variants of a campaign, read from the jsonb mapping table via the GIN index
GET {{DataPartitioningProject.API_HostAddress}}/campaigns/42/variant-mappings
Accept: application/json

### Campaign ids of a variant
GET {{DataPartitioningProject.API_HostAddress}}/variants/1/campaigns
Accept: application/json

### Add a variant to a campaign
POST {{DataPartitioningProject.API_HostAddress}}/variants/1/campaigns
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "campaignId": 42,
  "salePrice": 99.90
}

###
